-- 8. Afterimage — open coda. The room keeps the shape after the sound.
-- ~40+ cycles at 92 BPM; open-ended.

setbpm 92

-- strip the rhythm and most of the harmony
fadeSilence 16 [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9]

-- leave a high piano shadow, filtered trumpet, metal and air
xfadeIn 5 24 pianoAfter
xfadeIn 8 32 trumpetAfter
xfadeIn 9 24 metalSpark
xfadeIn 10 32 (stack [air, windBed])

-- the bass returns once, very low
xfadeIn 6 24 bassAfter

-- the last chord: let it ring
xfadeIn 4 32 (pianoLo (slow 8 hAfter) # gain 0.5 # lpf 1200 # room 0.8 # size 0.85)

-- hush when the room has decayed
hush
